    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205950/extras/bda75da8f16d5005434349bf2852bc18.poster.avif?t=1748859645\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205950/extras/bda75da8f16d5005434349bf2852bc18.webm?t=1748859645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205950/extras/bda75da8f16d5005434349bf2852bc18.mp4?t=1748859645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Not your average visual novel, Seeds of Chaos is a dark fantasy tale with RPG elements inspired by influential CRPG titles of years gone by.<br><br>Follow the story of Rowan Blackwell, former hero, as he finds himself forced to serve the dark bidding of a nefarious evil. Descend into darkness and join our hero on a journey of corruption and betrayal. <strong>Will you be able to maintain your heroic spirit, or will you live to become the undoing of everything you once fought for?</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205950/extras/28ef61d9fa42b77e7ecd8f418b79b431.poster.avif?t=1748859645\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205950/extras/28ef61d9fa42b77e7ecd8f418b79b431.webm?t=1748859645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205950/extras/28ef61d9fa42b77e7ecd8f418b79b431.mp4?t=1748859645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Jam packed with over 15 hours of playtime and diverse game systems, Seeds of Chaos has more than enough content to keep you ensnared for days on end.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Reactive Storytelling-</strong> branching which makes each playthrough feel personal &amp; rewarding!<br></li><li><strong>Indulge In Your Desires-</strong> debauchery awaits with over 100 unlockable sex scenes!<br></li><li><strong>Explore A Rich Fantasy World-</strong> explore a map filled with discoveries and adventure!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205950/extras/88ccf61b86e25dbad1ebd579a57e7de6.poster.avif?t=1748859645\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205950/extras/88ccf61b86e25dbad1ebd579a57e7de6.webm?t=1748859645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205950/extras/88ccf61b86e25dbad1ebd579a57e7de6.mp4?t=1748859645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Seeds of Chaos is the first part of a planned trilogy. If you complete this game, your unique progress and storyline will carry over to the next part of the story.</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205950/extras/bda75da8f16d5005434349bf2852bc18.poster.avif?t=1748859645\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205950/extras/bda75da8f16d5005434349bf2852bc18.webm?t=1748859645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205950/extras/bda75da8f16d5005434349bf2852bc18.mp4?t=1748859645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Not your average visual novel, Seeds of Chaos is a dark fantasy tale with RPG elements inspired by influential CRPG titles of years gone by.<br><br>Follow the story of Rowan Blackwell, former hero, as he finds himself forced to serve the dark bidding of a nefarious evil. Descend into darkness and join our hero on a journey of corruption and betrayal. <strong>Will you be able to maintain your heroic spirit, or will you live to become the undoing of everything you once fought for?</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205950/extras/28ef61d9fa42b77e7ecd8f418b79b431.poster.avif?t=1748859645\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205950/extras/28ef61d9fa42b77e7ecd8f418b79b431.webm?t=1748859645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205950/extras/28ef61d9fa42b77e7ecd8f418b79b431.mp4?t=1748859645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Jam packed with over 15 hours of playtime and diverse game systems, Seeds of Chaos has more than enough content to keep you ensnared for days on end.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Reactive Storytelling-</strong> branching which makes each playthrough feel personal &amp; rewarding!<br></li><li><strong>Indulge In Your Desires-</strong> debauchery awaits with over 100 unlockable sex scenes!<br></li><li><strong>Explore A Rich Fantasy World-</strong> explore a map filled with discoveries and adventure!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205950/extras/88ccf61b86e25dbad1ebd579a57e7de6.poster.avif?t=1748859645\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205950/extras/88ccf61b86e25dbad1ebd579a57e7de6.webm?t=1748859645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205950/extras/88ccf61b86e25dbad1ebd579a57e7de6.mp4?t=1748859645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Seeds of Chaos is the first part of a planned trilogy. If you complete this game, your unique progress and storyline will carry over to the next part of the story.</strong>",
